  "name": "Liaison Committee (Lords)",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Liaison Committee&nbsp;advises the House on the resources required for select committee work and allocate resources between select committees; reviews the select committee work of the House; considers requests for Special Inquiry Committees and reports to the House with recommendations&nbsp;to ensure effective co-ordination between the two Houses and to consider the availability of members to serve on committees</p>",
